      "4_02_restatement": "Item 4.02 non-reliance on prior financials",
      "8_01_other": "Item 8.01 other events / 7.01 Reg FD",
      "none": "Not an 8-K or cannot tell"
     }
    },
    "material": {
     "type": "noul",
     "instructions": "Is the reported event material to the company's value?",
